  "title": "The Serpent's Oath | An Anatolian Legend | Full Fantasy Film",
  "description": "A work of fiction. All people and animals in this film are AI-generated. No real animals were harmed.<br><br>A young herb-gatherer falls into a hidden well and finds a garden beneath the mountains, ruled by Shahmaran, the Queen of the Serpents. She teaches him every herb that heals and every root that kills, and she lets him go home on one condition: he must never tell anyone that she exists. Years later, a poisoned king, a scheming vizier and the soldiers at the palace gates put that promise to the test.<br><br>The Serpent&apos;s Oath is an original cinematic retelling inspired by the legend of Shahmaran, told for centuries in the mountains of Anatolia and Mesopotamia.<br><br>Chapters<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI\">0:00</a> Prologue<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI&amp;t=35\">0:35</a> Chapter One: The Honey Well<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI&amp;t=294\">4:54</a> Chapter Two: The Garden Below<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI&amp;t=743\">12:23</a> Chapter Three: The Mark<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI&amp;t=856\">14:16</a> Chapter Four: The King&apos;s Cup<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI&amp;t=1055\">17:35</a> Chapter Five: The Oath<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JGJqirpmMyI&amp;t=1509\">25:09</a> Chapter Six: Name It<br><br>Written &amp; directed by Gilded Myth Pictures<br>Cast: Jamsab, the herb-gatherer · Shahmaran, Queen of the Serpents · Nana, his mother · Rustam, his companion · Zerdan, the grand vizier · The King<br>Music: YouTube Audio Library<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/mythology\">#mythology</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fantasyfilm\">#fantasyfilm</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/legend\">#legend</a>",
